OL,3,AAlmost half of households do not see
OL,4,Abenefits of economic growth, report
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe findings come as Prime Minister
OL,8,FAndy Burnham has pledged to tackle
OL,9,Fregional inequalities in a bid to boost
OL,10,Fliving standards across the country.
OL,12,FBut questions remain over the PM's
OL,13,Fplans, with surging government
OL,14,Fborrowing costs set to limit his room
OL,15,Ffor manoeuvre at October's Budget.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
