OL,3,AToxic haze from wildfires spreads
OL,4,Aacross South East Asia as 'super' El
OL,5,ANino intensifies
OL,6,
OL,7,FMillions of people in Sumatra and the
OL,8,FIndonesian portion of Borneo island,
OL,9,FKalimantan, have been exposed to toxic
OL,10,Fhaze from the fires. The haze has also
OL,11,Fspread to neighbouring Malaysia, and
OL,12,Ffarther north in the Philippines
OL,14,FThe fires threaten to activate
OL,15,Fso-called "carbon bombs": huge
OL,16,Freservoirs of carbon stored beneath
OL,17,FIndonesia's peatlands that are
OL,18,Fthousands of years old
OL,20,FThousands of people in Indonesia have
OL,21,Fbeen admitted to hospital with
OL,22,Frespiratory infections
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
