OL,3,ACould Lindsay Clancy trial end in a
OL,4,Amistrial? Here are the jury's options
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a gruelling five-week murder
OL,7,Ftrial, Lindsay Clancy's fate rests with
OL,8,F12 anonymous jurors. And they cannot
OL,9,Fmake up their minds.
OL,11,FThe jury of nine women and three men
OL,12,Fhave told the judge, two days in a row,
OL,13,Fthat they cannot reach a unanimous
OL,14,Fdecision. Despite the judge's continued
OL,15,Furging that jurors keep at it, the
OL,16,Fstruggle has raised the prospect of a
OL,17,Fmistrial in Clancy's case.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
